p.me:
\begin{array}{ll}
\text{1.} \amp \text{Is the candidate inside the physical domain?}\\
\text{2.} \amp \text{Have the endpoints been checked?}\\
\text{3.} \amp \text{Is the result local or absolute?}\\
\text{4.} \amp \text{Does the sign or unit of the answer make sense?}\\
\text{5.} \amp \text{For Newton's method, do the iterates stabilize and is \(f(x_n)\) small?}
\end{array}
